      "content": "Yes, the pattern is highly intentional, and your term \"low-entropy\" is quite apt for describing their function. These phrases are structurally designed to be predictable and low in cognitive resistance, meaning the brain doesn't have to work hard to process them. They act as linguistic smoothers, allowing the core message to glide past the critical filter without friction. This predictability creates a sense of narrative inevitability, making the audience feel that the next step is the only logical one.",
